<section vertical-align="center" id="bbs033" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Hand-offs between teams as an interlocking arrow band under a working title, with one lead-in sentence; each cell a team name and one line on what it passes on. The chevrons renumber themselves and interlock only with spacing none.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="EUaNlj1ndo"><h2>Where the work changes hands</h2><p style="padding-right: 24%">Each hand-off is confirmed in writing before the next team starts, so a missed step shows up the same week rather than at the quarterly review.</p><grid style="--marker-chip-padding: 0.75em" padding="1em" vertical-sizing="hug" spacing="none" marker-fill="true" marker-align="center" marker-position="above" marker-shape="chevron" marker-style="subtle" marker-size="large" marker="number"><grid-item colspan="15" id="7HSUL74F5g"><h4>Sales</h4><p>Confirms the standing order in writing.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="15" id="KIU5eoXPWC"><h4>Sales Operations</h4><p>Lists the account by region and volume.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="15" id="2rbjWLid0w"><h4>Operations</h4><p>Fixes the route and reserves the stock.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="15" id="_gBd7XKDOu"><h4>Finance</h4><p>Checks the account against plan each month.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>